// Business Problem - 1. Business problem statement
As consumers increasingly use AI platforms such as ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, Perplexity and Google AI Mode to discover beauty products and retailers, Sephora India may be losing opportunities to reach potential customers because AI-generated shopping answers mention and recommend Nykaa more frequently than Sephora.

This creates a potential challenge for Sephora in building brand awareness, influencing customer consideration, and attracting online shoppers through AI-driven discovery.
